<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 6: </span>Comparison of VLM analysis-based frame selection methods on NextQA. <span id="S4.T6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">#Analyzed</span> means the number of frames through VLM Analysis. ‘<span id="S4.T6.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">TF</span>’ denotes whether training-free or not. We use InternVL3-8B. The same applies to Tab. <a href="#S4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 4.3 Ablation Study ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ A.I.R.: Adaptive, Iterative, and Reasoning-based Frame Selection For Video Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</figcaption>
